# This site is a static export (GitHub Pages) — there is no server runtime,
# so there are no secret env vars. These are the only optional settings:

# Base path for a GitHub Pages PROJECT site (https://<user>.github.io/<repo>/).
# The deploy workflow sets this automatically; you only need it for local
# testing of a subpath build, e.g.:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=/your-repo-name

# The contact form endpoint is configured in data/site.ts (contactFormEndpoint),
# not here, because it is a public URL baked into the static build.
